{"id":"jrwsy5g7nxepjktlqhp2xclwz","title":"以太坊智能合约中嵌入动态PIN的加密账户研究","originalTitle":"Encrypted Account: a PIN that lives in the contract","summary":"以太坊研究团队发布基于Zama阈值FHE的加密账户原型，通过链上动态验证PIN实现防暴力破解。测试显示在Sepolia链上，PIN验证转账平均需2.7万Gas，公开列表版本成本降低至60k Gas。方案存在Zama网络信任依赖、指纹泄露风险（需2天破解）等局限，支持多设备签名和托管的账户恢复机制。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Ethereum Research"},"links":{"original":"https://ethresear.ch/t/encrypted-account-a-pin-that-lives-in-the-contract/26265#post_1"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T20:59:16.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T21:58:50.820Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T21:58:50.820Z","category":"crypto-defi","tags":["产品上线","研究报告","Ethereum"],"score":52,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"dabb214a-f03b-4180-836a-4f3cfd32f9b6","title":"以太坊推出动态PIN加密账户，测试显示Gas成本降低"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"@Himess Semih Civelek","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"dabb214a-f03b-4180-836a-4f3cfd32f9b6","title":"以太坊推出动态PIN加密账户，测试显示Gas成本降低"}],"topics":[{"slug":"ethereum","name":"以太坊 / ETH"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"ffWk8C7SUkqA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}